<title>JAPAN: Misawa Ceramic Chemical to be delisted on March 25.</title>
<headline>Misawa Ceramic Chemical to be delisted on March 25.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Misawa Ceramic Chemical Co Ltd, a specialist manufacturer of ceramic housing materials, said on Wednesday its shares would be delisted from the second section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange on March 25.</p>
<p>The delisting will precede the firm's liquidation on April 1, when it will be merged with Misawa Ceramics Corp, another firm in the same Misawa Homes Co Ltd group.</p>
<p>Shares in Misawa Ceramics Corp, which produces prefabricated ceramic outer walls for houses, are listed on the second section of the Nagoya Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
